# A Pikachu with four moves it already knows and one TM it can learn, which is
# the only arrangement that reaches the move-overwrite prompt: a mon with a
# free slot learns the move inside the app and never asks.
#
# The four moves are set explicitly rather than left to the level-up table,
# because which moves a level-25 Pikachu happens to know is upstream's to
# change and the prompt only appears when all four slots are full.

name TEACHER
gender GENDER_FEMALE
trainer-id 30120
money 4000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_CHIMCHAR
party SPECIES_PIKACHU 25 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_THUNDER_SHOCK
party-move 0 1 MOVE_GROWL
party-move 0 2 MOVE_QUICK_ATTACK
party-move 0 3 MOVE_THUNDER_WAVE
item ITEM_TM24 1
map MAP_HEADER_SOLACEON_TOWN 0x236 0x291 FACE_DOWN
